rs/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPTVU5V1FsQlRXRTAxVFZWV1JWSXpWa2RWTTBaVlYwWktNRnByUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPTVU5V1FsQlRXRTAxVFZWV1JWSXpWa2RWTTBaVlYwWktNRnByUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPTVU5V1FsQlRXRTAxVFZWV1JWSXpWa2RWTTBaVlYwWktNRnByUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n感謝您選擇至一風堂新莊宏匯店用餐，對於當日讓您在飢餓的狀況下久候，以及餐點處理不當的情形，我們深感抱歉。\n經內部確認，當下於餐點送錯後的處理方式未符合我們應有的作業標準。雖然經確認人員有向顧客確認無碰到餐點，然而，餐點一旦送上桌，即不應再提供給其他顧客，應重新製作新的餐點，此為我們在教育訓練上未落實所導致的疏失。\n我們會再次加強相關作業流程，並要求夥伴確實遵守餐點製作與提供標準，以確保食品衛生與顧客權益。\n再次為當日未能提供符合期待的用餐體驗向您致上誠摯的歉意，我們也會持續檢視並精進服務品質，期望未來能帶給您更好的體驗。\n祝日安\n台灣一風堂敬上 J",null,[0,61]]]],[null,null,1052,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOMU9WQlBTWE01TVVWRVIzVkdVM0ZVV0ZKMFprRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x8512f40208719cef!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlN1OVBPSXM5MUVER3VGU3FUWFJ0ZkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOMU9WQlBTWE01TVVWRVIzVkdVM0ZVV0ZKMFprRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOMU9WQlBTWE01TVVWRVIzVkdVM0ZVV0ZKMFprRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOMU9WQlBTWE01TVVWRVIzVkdVM0ZVV0ZKMFprRRILMGUtOG4wX0RVNGYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sTjFPVkJQU1hNNU1VVkVSM1ZHVTNGVVdGSjBaa0USCzBlLThuMF9EVTRmIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR75xxCAL0EoUqCzBlLThuMF9EVTRm\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiXz8HAyNKWAxXfka8BHZvsPP4QoykIdCgH"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwifwcnAyNKWAxXHdV4EHciYA40Q0pMFCCAoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiXz8HAyNKWAxXfka8BHZvsPP4Q0pMFCGooAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kdGRUaFFZbGxGYlRKMFEyMWhXVlZOWlMxNFNHYxAB",["0x0:0x8512f40208719cef",null,1757139862669257,1757139862669257,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107899788142182421090/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"