A",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiXz8HAyNKWAxXfka8BHZvsPP4Q3YcHCPUBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiXz8HAyNKWAxXfka8BHZvsPP4Q3IcHCPQBKBE",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["開胃小菜涼拌豆芽不錯吃微辣（不夠還可以免費加）\n\n當天點的是雙人套餐，不需要加收服務費這點很優\n（但不知道是不是沒有收服務費當天去就一個人外場服務有時感覺不到位😅）\n\n豚骨拉麵湯很濃郁，麵條Q彈非常好吃😋\n（湯頭喝一口品嚐就好，因為日本拉麵湯頭就是偏鹹）\n\n玉子拉麵看起來就是比較清澈的湯底，麵條也稍稍細一點，但加了雞油吃起來香～👍\n\n日式炸雞塊：非常非常好吃！單點四塊170是有點小貴，點雙人套餐雖然只有三塊但還不錯，雞肉鮮嫩多汁，外皮不是那種厚厚的澱粉，一點酥脆的口感嗆當好處超推👍（前提不心疼價格😅）\n\n附上的小菜當天是：（牛蒡）老實說兩份小菜都是這個感覺是單調了一點，希望能多兩三個選擇！\n\n最後最後（日式煎餃🥟）這個…..我最不推….\n豬肉味很重，裡面的肉吃起來就是在吃奇美水餃🥟只是拿來煎，內餡口感也不是很好，很一般我本人是覺得不好吃，當然這還是看大家的判斷，個人意見不代表群體😅",null,[0,47]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXY2xONlJqTlZiRmswVTFSQ2EyRnJXbWxOUkdRelltNVplRlZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXY2xONlJqTlZiRmswVTFSQ2EyRnJXbWxOUkdRelltNVplRlZyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXY2xONlJqTlZiRmswVTFSQ2EyRnJXbWxOUkdRelltNVplRlZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXY2xONlJqTlZiRmswVTFSQ2EyRnJXbWxOUkdRelltNVplRlZyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXY2xONlJqTlZiRmswVTFSQ2EyRnJXbWxOUkdRelltNVplRlZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2680037223437516121/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXY2xONlJqTlZiRmswVTFSQ2EyRnJXbWxOUkdRelltNVplRlZyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3614,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d